    "description": "Administrative units is based on the data set swissBOUNDARIES3D by swisstopo. It contains all administrative units and national boundaries of Switzerland and the Principality of Liechtenstein in vector form. The product is based on an optimized data model for Switzerland and conforms to the data of the Swiss Federal Statistical Office and European INSPIRE directives. swissBOUNDARIES3D replaces the GG25 dataset from 2010 onwards.",
